				<description>


&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;scale EN-base&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;class1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;base false EN&quot;&gt;3/5313&lt;/span&gt; LEVEL &lt;span class=&quot;base false EN&quot;&gt;3/5313&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span&gt;CLASSIFIED&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;class1image&quot; rowspan=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/component:classified-decoration-base/classified-lv3.png&quot; alt=&quot;classified-lv3.png&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;item1 EN&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span&gt;Item #: SCP-5313&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span&gt;Object Class: Euclid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-5313/SCP-5313.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot; alt=&quot;SCP-5313.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5313-1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #&lt;/strong&gt;: SCP-5313&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class&lt;/strong&gt;: Euclid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures&lt;/strong&gt;: SCP-5313 is to be kept in a 20&amp;#160;cm by 20&amp;#160;cm fire-resistant cage. No personnel are allowed inside 5313&#039;s containment cell, with the exception of Class-D, unless stated by O5 command. SCP-5313&#039;s containment chamber was moved to Site-37 following incident 5313-A.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description&lt;/strong&gt;: SCP-5313 is a group of humanoid-like entities which appear to be engulfed by flames. These entities are reported to be extremely violent and can become agitated when conditions are correct.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These conditions can include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Humidity levels under 52%.&lt;br /&gt;
- No precipitation for more than █ days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If a person is to approach SCP-5313, it will approach the subject and engulf it in flames. Once this person is engulfed in flames, they are refered to as 5313-1. The anomalous effects of SCP-5313 set in after ██ hours after exposure. The effects can range from a bacterial infection which has many similaries that of &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-008/&quot;&gt;SCP-008&lt;/a&gt; to sudden cardiac arrest.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;+&amp;nbsp;[Incident&amp;nbsp;5313-A]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject&lt;/strong&gt;: D-18231, a 42-year-old Caucasian Male with a strong build&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Date&lt;/strong&gt;: December 14th, 2020.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Incident Log&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;12:03&lt;/strong&gt;: D-18231, now known as 5313-1, is engulfed by flames.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;13:04&lt;/strong&gt;: SCP-5313-1 breaches containment. The way SCP-5313-1 breached containment is currently unknown.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;End Incident 5313-1&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/avcado&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7181977&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609384703&quot; alt=&quot;avcado&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7181977)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/avcado&quot;  &gt;avcado&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 31 Dec 2020 00:11:11 +0000</pubDate>
												<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
